        {
          "id": 686735119,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "What's the use case? As this is the last fragment, the field will point to itself which makes it quite useless IMHO.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6722527,
            "username": "pquantin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Pascal Quantin",
