          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Code moved from [packet-ip.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commits/master/epan/dissectors/packet-ip.c) to [reassemble.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/reassemble.c) here: https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/87dfb09b12cd9d0df1ed278594fb376fb95f769b  \n  \nOriginal added to [packet-ip.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commits/master/epan/dissectors/packet-ip.c) here: https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/37e401385ce1196fb6ef71c4896a4ffa6b421185  \n  \n@sahlberg  was it by design that the last fragment not include reassembled_in ?",
