        {
          "id": 1050079288,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, this can be done with a filter button but two would be required depending on if it is the last segment.  \nEasier to right click the field and apply as a filter.\n\n```\n# This file is automatically generated, DO NOT MODIFY.\n\"TRUE\",\"arp\",\"arp\",\"\"\n\"TRUE\",\"all_segments_notlast\",\"frame.number==${tcp.reassembled_in} or tcp.reassembled_in==${tcp.reassembled_in}\",\"\"\n\"TRUE\",\"all_segments_last\",\"frame.number==${frame.number} or tcp.reassembled_in==${frame.number}\",\"\"\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
